<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅτε</span></b> , properly acc. pl. neut. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅστε</span> (as in <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			11.779
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			22.127
		</span></i>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>just as, as if, so as,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅ. σήριον ἄστρον</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				23.62
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				4.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				168
			</span></i> (lyr., s. v. l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμᾶν τινα ἅ. ἱερόφαντιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.221c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>inasmuch as, seeing that,</i> with part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅτε τὸν χρυσὸν ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.154
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				102
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				295
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				623
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.130
			</span></i>, etc.: with gen. abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅτε τῶν ὁδῶν φυλασσομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.123
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				223b
			</span></i>, etc.:—with part. omitted, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυα δοὺς [αὐτῷ] ἅτε θηρευτῇ
			[ὄντι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅ. γένους
			προμάτωρ</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				140
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅ. δή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.171
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅ. δὴ οὖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					321b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἅ.</span> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				39.12
			</span></i>, al.—Rare in Trag., and onlv in lyr.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
